              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "il reclamo — \"the complaint (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ho scritto un reclamo alla direzione. I wrote a complaint to the management."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fare reclamo — to lodge a complaint."
            }
          ]
